# One line ending everywhere: the code runs in Linux containers, and mixed endings break
# byte comparisons and shell scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
# The comparison dataset as it was published: its checksums name these bytes, BOM and CRLF too
data/seed/vergleichsdatensatz/*.csv -text
# The tokenizer's encoding as tiktoken fetches it: its SHA-256 names these bytes (app/llm/budget.py);
# 200,000 lines of base64 no diff should print
*.tiktoken -text -diff
